> asansuer at virbac.fr

library(Hmisc)
rcorr.cens(prediction, outcome)

This gives you Somers' Dxy rank correlation between prediction and 
binary outcome and its standard error.  Dxy = 2*(C-.5) where C is the 
ROC area or concordance probability.

