From: timh at insightful.com (Tim Hesterberg)
Date: Tue, 12 Sep 2006 14:43:49 -0700
Subject: Re: Gauss-Hermite quadrature fomula
In-Reply-To: <BAY18-F25F8AF73131A538624449BA32B0@phx.gbl>
