I'm not sure why you would want to, but you can pass in the formula as 
an argument to the panel function:

my.panel <- function(x, y, subscripts, f, z, ...) {
###
}

xyplot(my.formula, my.data, panel = my.panel,
       f = my.formula, z = my.data)

HTH,

--sundar

