Vincent,

  The tabulate() function will
convert anything to factors and process those data correctly. It is the
subsetting [m$X] that must be integer. 

  You can use the by() function
and do.call("rbind", ) to do what you want:

do.call("rbind", by(m, m$X,
function(x) if(nrow(x) > 2) x else NULL))

  Take a look at the documentation
for the functions to see what they do.

Dave

